  "obj_unusedclassevent_slash_Step_0_gml_16_0": "＊ Wh..^1. what happened!^2?&＊ I can't see anything!!/%",
  "obj_unusedclassevent_slash_Step_0_gml_52_0": "＊ Hey^1, WATCH IT!/%",
  "obj_unusedclassevent_slash_Step_0_gml_94_0": "＊ H..^1. Huh...?/",
