  "scr_text_slash_scr_text_gml_1774_0": "＊ (次は　どっちだ…？)/",
  "scr_text_slash_scr_text_gml_1720_0": "\\C2 ",
  "scr_text_slash_scr_text_gml_1781_0": "\\E9＊ え…？　クリス…^1？&　 いま　なんか言ったか？/",
  "scr_text_slash_scr_text_gml_1782_0": "\\E0＊ (…クソッ&　 さすがに　ここまでは&　 声が届かねえか…)/%",
