  "obj_homealone_dess_convo_slash_Create_0_gml_149_0": "＊\\E2 その　ぶぶんはな。",
  "obj_homealone_dess_convo_slash_Create_0_gml_150_0": "＊\\EO (スージィの　うしろで\n　 なにか　ゆれてるけど？)",
  "obj_homealone_dess_convo_slash_Create_0_gml_153_0": "＊\\E0 (しばらく　だまっとこう…)",
  "obj_homealone_dess_phone_slash_Create_0_gml_34_0": "…\nスージィ…\nギター…？",
